<section class="copy-section" id="personal-work-with-clear-authority" aria-labelledby="personal-work-with-clear-authority-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="personal-work-with-clear-authority-heading">Personal work, with clear authority</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>Shared business accounts are reviewed only where lawful access and agreed authority permit. A dispute does not itself authorize changes to company systems or another person&apos;s accounts.</p>
<p>Toza is not a corporate security audit, security-operations service or counter-espionage engagement. We do not investigate the other side, reconstruct events forensically, collect legal evidence or give legal opinions. We do not promise to find or close every possible access path.</p>
<p>You remain present, approve material changes and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use, remotely control your devices, monitor them or install security software on them.</p>
<p>Your attorney or adviser can be involved with your permission. An authorized summary explains the work; it is not a forensic report or evidence document. <a href="/en/faq.html">Privacy and service boundaries</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/attorneys.html">Information for attorneys</a></p>
</div></div></section>
